Generate genre-based and region-based playlists

Usage: playlists [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --dry-run        Dry run - show what would be created without writing to DB
      --report         Show all genres and their group assignments
      --group <GROUP>  Update only a specific generator (by slug)
      --no-genres      Skip genre playlists
      --no-regions     Skip region playlists
  -h, --help           Print help
